      "content": "wait, bells palsy?? i didn't even know that was a thing. is that dangerous? i'm mostly just worried because the headache is still pounding and i felt kinda dizzy too. you think the ibuprofen will fix the speech thing pretty quickly? i really don't want to deal with a doctor if it's just a nerve thing or dehydration.",
